;verticalAlign=bottom;labelWidth=150;" vertex="1" parent="lane_org"><mxGeometry x="1384" y="69" width="52" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t23" value="&lt;b&gt;23. Decide: open gates, release sections, flag a buyer&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#333333;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="lane_org"><mxGeometry x="1505" y="62" width="170" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e_decided" value="Decision taken" style="shape=mxgraph.bpmn.event;html=1;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;outlineConnect=0;aspect=fixed;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=none;outline=end;symbol=terminate2;fillColor=#FFEBEE;strokeColor=#B71C1C;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelWidth=110;" vertex="1" parent="lane_org"><mxGeometry x="1732" y="77" width="36" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.45&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Data activities (task 4 of the brief)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1B7F3B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;C&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Create: inserts a new record&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F5FA8&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;R&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Retrieve: reads or consults records&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C25E00&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;U&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Update: changes an existing record (→ new status)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7A1F1F&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;D&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Delete / archive: none. Records are never deleted; a cancelled or&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;expired booking only changes status, and AUDIT_LOG is append-only.&lt;br&gt;Thick border = task that touches data. ORA-200xx = error raised by PL/SQL.&lt;br&gt;Solid arrow = sequence flow; labels show the information passed.&lt;br&gt;Dashed arrow = read-only information flow (data association).&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounde